desc: Grand Designs Electric Grand (Greg Sullivan CP80 samples) by chmaha
tags: instrument electric-piano sampled
author: chmaha
version: 1.0
changelog:
  Initial preview.
about:
  A sampled 88-key electric grand: Greg Sullivan's Yamaha CP80 samples played through a port of the sfizz
  SFZ engine. 81 samples in four velocity layers with the sustain loops stored in the sample files, the
  instrument file's release (CC72) and velocity tracking (CC99) controls, and the sustain pedal (CC64)
  with half-pedalling and re-pedalling.
  Needs Dependencies/GrandDesigns/GrandDesigns.txt and GrandDesigns.flac.
  Ported from sfizz 1.2.3 (sfizz authors, https://sfz.tools/sfizz, BSD 2-clause).
  Samples: Yamaha CP80 Electric Grand Piano v1.3 by Greg Sullivan (http://www.sullivang.net), CC BY 4.0; SFZ mapping by kinwie
  (https://github.com/sfzinstruments/GregSullivan.E-Pianos), CC BY 3.0. Joined into one FLAC
  (Dependencies/GrandDesigns/GrandDesigns-LICENSE.txt).
  JSFX code released under GPLv3+ license
  Claude generated some of this code
provides:
  Dependencies/GrandDesigns/GrandDesigns.txt
  Dependencies/GrandDesigns/GrandDesigns.flac
  Dependencies/GrandDesigns/GrandDesigns-LICENSE.txt

